# ── LiveKit rooms ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local — one file at this directory serves everything: station,
# the web app in web/, and every room and research run station spawns.

# ── LiveKit (REQUIRED) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The transport. Both the agent (server-side, @livekit/rtc-node) and the
# browser join a LiveKit room; audio rides WebRTC tracks in both directions.
# LiveKit Cloud (free tier works) or a self-hosted server — the app mints
# short-lived join tokens itself from the API key/secret, so the browser
# never sees these.
LIVEKIT_URL=wss://your-project.livekit.cloud
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=API...
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=...

# The realtime provider that drives the front agent. OpenAI Realtime
# (gpt-realtime over WebSocket) or Gemini Live. Default picks whichever key
# is set, OpenAI first; force with S2S_PROVIDER=openai|gemini.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AI...
# S2S_PROVIDER=openai
# S2S_MODEL=            # empty = provider default (gpt-realtime / gemini-live-2.5-flash-preview)
# S2S_VOICE=            # empty = provider default (marin / Puck)

# The WORKER's model — the capable one with the full shop-database tool
# surface, run as a research signal. Default provider is OpenRouter.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# WORKER_MODEL=minimax/minimax-m2.5

# ── Station auth (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Station's API can start processes on this machine, so it is gated — station
# refuses to boot without these, and there is deliberately no default.
STATION_USERNAME=admin
STATION_PASSWORD=change-me

# The web app's only credential. Start station, then:
#   pnpm key "web app" trigger read cancel
# and put the result here (or in web/.env.local).
# STATION_API_KEY=sk_live_...

# This example runs SIDE BY SIDE with the rest of the voice series: station on
# :4430 (s2s-rooms :4410, avatar-rooms :4420), room signal ports :4801+, web
# on :3003. The room's port now carries only health + mesh — audio is
# LiveKit's problem. Override if needed:
# STATION_URL=http://localhost:4430
# STATION_DB=./station.db
# ROOM_SLOTS=4
# ROOM_BASE_PORT=4800
# ROOM_MAX_MS=3600000
# MESH_TOKEN=dev-token
